Relevance: Primary source of truth for Nous Research visual identity. Typography (Courier New / Helvetica / Times), color palette (void black, white, amber/gold), layout philosophy, and manifesto language all inform the Edgeless Lab design system.

Key sections:
- Core Philosophy ("decentralization of good design practice")
- Typography System (Courier Nous lead, Helvetica Swiss, Times editorial)
- Color Palette (void #000000, white #FFFFFF, amber #D4A574, gold #C9A96E)
- Layout & Grid (military/intel briefing format, justified text, all-caps hierarchy)
- Photography Direction (natural world integration, builders of old)
- Application Examples (social templates, letterhead, merchandise)

